{"id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-volume-form-induced","title":"prop:hypersurface-volume-form-induced","path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.md","line":1669,"body":"","kind":"theorem","status":"not_started","tex":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex#prop:hypersurface-volume-form-induced","uses":["[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-orientation]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:induced-orientation-characterization]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:top-form-eq-of-basis]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:volume-form-value-one]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:interior-multiplication]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:unit-normal]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","label":"prop:hypersurface-volume-form-induced","line":2782,"source":"\\begin{proposition}[Equation (2.17) for the Induced Orientation]\n\\label{prop:hypersurface-volume-form-induced}\n\n\\uses{def:induced-orientation, lem:induced-orientation-characterization, lem:top-form-eq-of-basis, prop:volume-form-value-one, def:interior-multiplication, def:unit-normal}\n\n\n\n\nFor an isometric immersion into an oriented Riemannian $(n+1)$-manifold, the orientation induced by a unit normal $N$ satisfies\n\\[\ndV_g=(N\\lrcorner dV_{\\widetilde g})|_M,\n\\]\nwithout any prior compatibility assumption between the orientations.\n\\end{proposition}\n\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\\uses{def:induced-orientation,lem:induced-orientation-characterization,lem:top-form-eq-of-basis,prop:volume-form-value-one}\n\\sketch Compare the two forms on any $g$-orthonormal basis. If the basis is positively oriented for the induced orientation, both values are $1$; otherwise both are $-1$, by Lemma \\ref{lem:induced-orientation-characterization}. Lemma \\ref{lem:top-form-eq-of-basis} finishes.\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proposition</div></section>[Equation (2.17) for the Induced Orientation] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-70726f703a6879706572737572666163652d766f6c756d652d666f726d2d696e6475636564\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Ainduced-orientation\">↗ def:induced-orientation</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Ainduced-orientation-characterization\">↗ lem:induced-orientation-characterization</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Atop-form-eq-of-basis\">↗ lem:top-form-eq-of-basis</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Avolume-form-value-one\">↗ prop:volume-form-value-one</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Ainterior-multiplication\">↗ def:interior-multiplication</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Aunit-normal\">↗ def:unit-normal</a> <p></p>For an isometric immersion into an oriented Riemannian <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(n+1)$\">$(n+1)$</span>-manifold, the orientation induced by a unit normal <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$N$\">$N$</span> satisfies <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[  dV_g=(N\\lrcorner dV_{\\widetilde g})|_M,  \\]\">\\[  dV_g=(N\\lrcorner dV_{\\widetilde g})|_M,  \\]</span> without any prior compatibility assumption between the orientations.  <p></p><section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Ainduced-orientation\">↗ def:induced-orientation</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Ainduced-orientation-characterization\">↗ lem:induced-orientation-characterization</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Atop-form-eq-of-basis\">↗ lem:top-form-eq-of-basis</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Avolume-form-value-one\">↗ prop:volume-form-value-one</a> \\sketch Compare the two forms on any <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$g$\">$g$</span>-orthonormal basis. If the basis is positively oriented for the induced orientation, both values are <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$1$\">$1$</span>; otherwise both are <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$-1$\">$-1$</span>, by Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Ainduced-orientation-characterization\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:induced-orientation-characterization\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a696e64756365642d6f7269656e746174696f6e2d636861726163746572697a6174696f6e\">8</a>. Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Atop-form-eq-of-basis\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:top-form-eq-of-basis\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a746f702d666f726d2d65712d6f662d6261736973\">8</a> finishes. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:top-form-eq-of-basis","next":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pullback-comp-section","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-orientation","title":"def:induced-orientation","label":"def:induced-orientation"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:induced-orientation-characterization","title":"lem:induced-orientation-characterization","label":"lem:induced-orientation-characterization"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:top-form-eq-of-basis","title":"lem:top-form-eq-of-basis","label":"lem:top-form-eq-of-basis"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:volume-form-value-one","title":"prop:volume-form-value-one","label":"prop:volume-form-value-one"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:interior-multiplication","title":"def:interior-multiplication","label":"def:interior-multiplication"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:unit-normal","title":"def:unit-normal","label":"def:unit-normal"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-volume-form-if","title":"prop:hypersurface-volume-form-if","label":"prop:hypersurface-volume-form-if"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-volume-form-only-if","title":"prop:hypersurface-volume-form-only-if","label":"prop:hypersurface-volume-form-only-if"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-volume-form","title":"prop:hypersurface-volume-form","label":"prop:hypersurface-volume-form"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-volume-form-induced","title":"prop:hypersurface-volume-form-induced","tex":"\\begin{proposition}[Equation (2.17) for the Induced Orientation]\n\\label{prop:hypersurface-volume-form-induced}\n\n\\uses{def:induced-orientation, lem:induced-orientation-characterization, lem:top-form-eq-of-basis, prop:volume-form-value-one, def:interior-multiplication, def:unit-normal}\n\n\n\n\nFor an isometric immersion into an oriented Riemannian $(n+1)$-manifold, the orientation induced by a unit normal $N$ satisfies\n\\[\ndV_g=(N\\lrcorner dV_{\\widetilde g})|_M,\n\\]\nwithout any prior compatibility assumption between the orientations.\n\\end{proposition}\n\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\\uses{def:induced-orientation,lem:induced-orientation-characterization,lem:top-form-eq-of-basis,prop:volume-form-value-one}\n\\sketch Compare the two forms on any $g$-orthonormal basis. If the basis is positively oriented for the induced orientation, both values are $1$; otherwise both are $-1$, by Lemma \\ref{lem:induced-orientation-characterization}. Lemma \\ref{lem:top-form-eq-of-basis} finishes.\n\\end{proof}","source":"tex/references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","description":"","dependencies":[{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-orientation","title":"def:induced-orientation","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:induced-orientation-characterization","title":"lem:induced-orientation-characterization","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:top-form-eq-of-basis","title":"lem:top-form-eq-of-basis","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:volume-form-value-one","title":"prop:volume-form-value-one","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:interior-multiplication","title":"def:interior-multiplication","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:unit-normal","title":"def:unit-normal","description":""}],"dependencies_omitted":0,"unresolved_dependencies":[],"unresolved_omitted":0}}